<title>UK: Sanwa Bank unit to launch $200 mln five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Sanwa Bank unit to launch $200 mln five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sanwa Business Credit Corp will launch a $200 million five-year FRN this week, syndicate managers said on Monday.</p>
<p>Merrill Lynch International and Sanwa international will likely lead manage the deal, they added.</p>
<p>U.S.-based finance company Sanwa Business Credit Corp, rated Aa3 by Moodys and A- by S&amp;P, is owned by Sanwa Bank Ltd .</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
